== Notes
1. The first 5.020 attempt (rc=2, 0 s) never reached the RTL: the wrapper set VERILATOR_ROOT to the unpacked
   deb's share/verilator, where the 5.020 driver looks for bin/verilator_bin. After linking
   share/verilator/bin/verilator_bin to the unpacked usr/bin/verilator_bin the lint ran: rc=0, 0 warnings.
   No repository change was involved.
2. sigil-fpga-build had no deps/ of its own. The clean clone got a project-local deps/: the Verilator 5.048
   install from the scripts/install_deps.sh build on sigil-fpga-build2, the pinned toolchain downloaded from
   GitHub, third_party clones at the install_deps.sh pins.
3. No gate failed. No fixes were needed.

